Ukraine Oil Deal argues that Trump admin's Ukraine talks include a multibillion-dollar oil deal benefiting allies. Trump making a deal with Russia regarding Ukraine that involves an oil deal. Trump's actions on Ukraine are driven by personal interests, including an oil deal. Ukraine Support argues that Ukraine should do what's best for itself. Ukraine has the right to protect itself. The US should support Ukraine.

@darthputinkgb.bsky.social: “I can’t defeat Ukraine on battlefield. My strategy is: 1 Bomb hospitals, schools,power & stations to create refugees 2 Fund anti western & anti refugee parties in west 3 Humiliate western leaders who want appeasement 4 Repeat”

Ukraine Oil Deal (54.8%) says Trump allies benefit from Ukraine oil deal. Ukraine Support (45.2%) says Ukraine should be supported.

Zionism Racism argues that Zionism refers to European Jewish supremacists' settler-colonialist project. Zionism is an ideology of ethnic cleansing. Zionism is a form of colonialism that tramples on other peoples and religions. Zionism is inflicted on Palestinians and Arabs in a racist manner. Gaza Crisis argues that Israel's treatment of Gaza is oppressive and violent. The UK government should stop supporting Israel's actions in Gaza. Israel's actions in Gaza are a form of genocide. The destruction of Gaza is a result of Israel's defensive measures. Israel's actions are causing immense human suffering in Gaza. Israel Condemned argues that Israel's actions are a result of genocidal intent. Israel's history of being attacked justifies its aggressive behavior. Israel is an occupation force that needs to leave. Israel Condemned argues that Labour is complicit in Israel's genocide in Gaza. Israel stages fake terrorist events to justify genocide. The US is complicit in Israel's actions in Gaza.

@marygillis.bsky.social: “Framing this as a result of the "fragility" of the system rather than a direct result of Israel's genocidal actions is a choice. One that other outlets managed to avoid making.”

Zionism Racism (30.5%) says Zionism is a racist ideology. Gaza Crisis (28.3%) says Israel's actions in Gaza are alarming. Israel Condemned (20.9%) says Israel is committing genocide. Israel Condemned (20.3%) says Israel is criticized for its actions.

US Iran War argues that US lacks exit strategy in Iran war. Iran demands conditions for Strait of Hormuz reopening. War with Iran affects US domestic politics. US considers military escalation in Iran. Iran seeks to damage US and Israel after attack. US invasion of Iran is a diversion. Iran War argues that Iran is menacing the Strait of Hormuz. Iran is threatening to bomb the UAE. Iran is being blamed for terror acts. War with Iran argues that War with Iran led to wider conflict. USA failed to meet strategic goals in War with Iran. Trump's war with Iran has failed. War with Iran has caused energy shock. Iran War argues that US should protest against Iran war. Trump's Iran policy is flawed and based on lies.

@mgearsolidarity.bsky.social: “Tell me more about how we want to be on America's side "when it all kicks off" now the Iran War has made some things more obvious to the more traditionally minded among you.”

US Iran War (44.5%) says US faces challenges in war with Iran. Iran War (19%) says Iran is a threat. War with Iran (19%) says War with Iran has led to wider conflict. Iran War (17.5%) says US should protest against Iran war.

Manchester City Cheating argues that Manchester City's hypocrisy is evident in their cheating. Other clubs had chances to win but failed, Manchester City's cheating is not an excuse. Manchester City's rule breaches are a mockery of the sport. The cheating will have a significant impact on Manchester City fans. City Cheated argues that City cheated to break into the top four. City's actions are widely discredited. City proves that cheating is the only way to succeed. Big clubs like City bend or break the rules. City's cheating makes fans sad for football as a sport. City Condemned argues that City's actions hurt other clubs. City's spending benefited the league. City's case shows nation-states should not own clubs. Premier League Crisis argues that other teams might abandon the league. cheating undermines the league's point.

@paultenorio.bsky.social: “Asked about Manchester City's rule breaches, #USMNT Mauricio Pochettino said "If it’s true that the 114 rules were broken, then we lived through a period of deception." "It’s deeply sad."”

Manchester City Cheating (38%) says Manchester City cheated on a large scale. City Cheated (24%) says Man City cheated in football. City Condemned (22%) says City is criticized for its actions. Premier League Crisis (16%) says Premier League faces crisis due to cheating and disrespect.

Medicare Payments argues that Trump's $90 payment is insignificant for seniors' health expenses. The payment is a bribe before midterm elections. The payment comes from raiding a special reserve fund for Medicare. The payment is a small consolation for increased Medicare costs. Medicare Payment argues that Medicare payment doesn't cover premium increases. Advantage plan recipients are excluded from payment. Payment barely covers monthly costs. Medicaid Cuts argues that Medicaid recipients will be forced to work in fields. Medicaid cuts will disproportionately hurt children. Medicaid cuts will limit access to prescription medication for seniors. Medicaid payment deferrals will harm states and providers. Medicaid cuts will devastate rural communities. Medicaid cuts will reduce access to healthcare services.

@sebastian2.bsky.social: “So, after he guts your Medicare and Social Security? A single tank of gas is covered... Trump announces $90 payments for seniors on Medicare ahead of midterm elections for premium costs”

Medicare Payments (45.7%) says Trump offers $90 to Medicare seniors. Medicare Payment (31.4%) says Medicare payment is insufficient. Medicaid Cuts (22.9%) says Medicaid cuts will harm recipients.

Trans Women Threat argues that Trans women bring violent misogyny. Trans women demand access to women's spaces. Trans women diminish womanhood. Trans women are a threat to lesbian culture. Trans women's presence increases harm to cis women. Trans Rights argues that Transphobia will spread to queer people. Trans people are pawns in a political war. Trans Rights argues that CPS guidance targets trans people. media spreads anti-trans propaganda. trans people's rights are ignored. Trans Rights argues that Transphobic efforts undermine care for trans kids. Trans people are denied healthcare. Trans people need material support. Trans bodies are neglected and abused. Anti-trans talking points target neurodivergent people.

@sloanelysbeth.bsky.social: “every time i call out transphobia on this platform i get mass blocked. it wasn't that long ago things working the other way around on here. white liberals have wrecked yet another place that was initially used as a *relative* safe haven by minorities.”

Trans Women Threat (34.8%) says Trans women pose a threat to cis women. Trans Rights (26.5%) says Trans people are under attack. Trans Rights (22.4%) says Trans people face discrimination. Trans Rights (16.3%) says Trans people lack rights.
